    "https://www.uoguelph.ca/facultyrelations/": {
      "title": "Faculty and Academic Staff Relations",
      "description": "Faculty and Academic Staff Relations | Skip to main content Toggle navigation GryphMail CourseLink Directory for University of Guelph Library Maps Gryphlife WebAdvisor Guelph Weather Search University of Guelph Search Academics at University of Guelph Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Studies Distance Education Academic Calendars College of Arts College of Biological Science College of Engineering & Physical Sciences College of Social & Applied Human Sciences Gordon S. Lang School of Business & Economics Ontario Agricultural College Ontario Veterinary College Ridgetown Campus University of Guelph-Humber Open Learning and Educational Support About University of Guelph About the University Arboretum Board of Governors Senate Senior Administration International President Research at University of Guelph Services at University of Guelph Athletics Bookstore Campus Safety Office Communications & Public Affairs Government Relations & Community Engagement Computing & Communications Services Hospitality Services Human Resources Student Affairs Student Housing Services More Services Faculty and Academic Staff Relations Toggle navigation Join U of G Faculty/Librarian/Veterinarian Positions Sessional/TA Opportunities Postdoctoral Fellowship Opportunities Non-Academic Positions New to U of G Information for New Employees Campus Resources Accessibility Information International Faculty Collective Agreements Faculty, Librarians & Veterinarians Faculty Librarians Veterinarians Chairs/Directors Collective Agreements UNIWeb College Professors College Professors Accessibility (College Professors) Performance Assessment Total Compensation Leaves College Lecturers Collective Agreements TAs, GSA-1s & Sessionals TAs, GSA-1s & Sessionals Accessibility (TAs, GSA-1s and Sessionals) UHIP Reimbursement Sessional Lecturer PDR Teaching and Career Development Fellowships Study and Development Fellowships Frequently Asked Questions Collective Agreements Administration Faculty Recruitment Guidelines Hiring International Academics Guidelines, Forms & Templates Adjunct Appointments Nil-Salary Academic Appointments Collective Agreements Contact Us Postdoctoral Scholars Slideshow Banners Slide 1 headline: Faculty and Academic Staff Relations COVID-19 Updates for Course Instructors About Faculty and Academic Staff Relations Reporting to the Provost and Vice-President Academic, the Office of Faculty and Academic Staff Relations (FASR) supports the academic mission and strategic research directions of the University of Guelph and the University of Guelph-Humber through the provision of professional advice and quality service to members of the University community on all matters pertaining to the terms and conditions of employment for faculty and academic staff. Faculty and Academic Staff Relations is responsible for labour relations (including collective bargaining) and is the primary point of communication with the University of Guelph Faculty Association (UGFA Units 1 and 2) and the Canadian Union of Public Employees, Local 3913 (CUPE 3913 Units 1 and 2). This includes responsibilities associated with approximately 3,300 faculty, librarians, veterinarians, sessional lecturers, graduate teaching and service assistants, college professors, college lecturers, postdoctoral fellows, and other academic staff across approximately 40 academic units. FASR values a healthy workplace environment that is diverse, inclusive, equitable, safe, supportive and respectful. Search form Search Faculty and Academic Staff Relations Search Search Full-Time Academic Positions Part-Time TA/SL Positions Collective Agreements UNIWeb Accessibility at University of Guelph Privacy at University of Guelph Site Map for University of Guelph © University of Guelph"
