    "https://uoguelph.jobs.hr.cloud.sap?locale=en_US": {
      "title": "University of Guelph Careers",
      "description": "University of Guelph Careers We use cookies to offer you the best possible website experience. Your cookie preferences will be stored in your browser’s local storage. This includes cookies necessary for the website's operation. Additionally, you can freely decide and change any time whether you accept cookies or choose to opt out of cookies to improve website's performance, as well as cookies used to display content tailored to your interests. Your experience of the site and the services we are able to offer may be impacted if you do not accept all cookies. Modify Cookie Preferences Accept All Cookies College (Research) Professor - Lecturer Executive Faculty, Librarian and Veterinarian Sessional Lecturer Staff and Management Teaching Assistant View All Careers Wellbeing Community Learning Applicant Resources Join Talent Community External Applicants Login Internal Applicants Login University of Guelph Careers Skip to main content Language English (United States) View Profile Language English (United States) View Profile Language English (United States) View Profile WARNING Please be advised: this is NOT a live site. To visit the University of Guelph Careers page, please follow this link Careers Search by Keyword Show More Options Loading... Division All Department All Employee Type All We're on a mission to Improve Life, join our team. By joining the campus as a Staff or Faculty member, you have the opportunity to contribute to creating good citizens and strong leaders, to supporting leading-edge learning and research innovation and to finding solutions to local and global challenges.  Through positive and respectful collaboration across a wide range of occupations at the University, we each have an important role to play.  What will yours be? Faculty Staff & Management Executive College Professor Teaching Assistant Sessional Lecturer Learning Leverage wide-ranging development opportunities that expand skills, knowledge and abilities and contribute to career success, achievements and overall wellbeing. Learning & Development University of Guelph students sitting around a table in groups within a study environment. Wellbeing Rest easy knowing the essentials are covered under the University's Group Benefit Plan while also enjoying other opportunities and programs that support employee wellbeing. Explore Wellness Programs University of Guelph Wellness at Work signage displayed at the event Community When you become a University of Guelph staff or faculty member, you join a friendly community of talented and dedicated people whose abilities, skills and actions provide essential support for the teaching and research activities for which the University is nationally recognized. University of Guelph Community University of Guelph faculty and staff walking on campus. Go to slide 1 Go to slide 2 Go to slide 3 Commitment to Diversity & Equity Featured Open Positions Staff and Management College Professor - Lecturer Faculty, Librarian and Veterinary Executive Teaching Assistant (CUPE 3913 Unit 1) Sessional Lecturer (CUPE 3913 Unit 2) The University of Guelph is committed to ensuring that its internal policies, practices, and systems are free of barriers, emphasize the value of diversity, and promote full participation to ensure dignity, respect, and equal access for all employees. The University of Guelph employs over 800 faculty members and nearly 3,000 staff members. The University of Guelph’s research enterprise supports a $158-million research complement across its colleges, research stations and Ridgetown Campus. The University of Guelph is one of Canada’s top comprehensive and research-intensive universities and is known as Canada’s Food University. Almost 30,000 undergraduate and graduate students are enrolled at campuses in Guelph, Ridgetown and Toronto. The Gryphon Go to slide 1 Go to slide 2 Go to slide 3 Go to slide 4 Join Our Talent Community Stay connected by joining our network! Enter your e-mail and we'll keep you informed about upcoming events and opportunities that match your interests. Experience Guelph Guelph Humber Ridgetown Policies Human Resources Faculty & Academic Staff Relations View All Careers U of G Home Student Portal - Experience Guelph Guelph Humber Portal Ridgetown Campus U of G Policies Human Resources Faculty & Academic Staff Relations View All Positions Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. © University of Guelph × Cookie Consent Manager When you visit any website, it may store or retrieve information on your browser, mostly in the form of cookies. Because we respect your right to privacy, you can choose not to allow some types of cookies. However, blocking some types of cookies may impact your experience of the site and the services we are able to offer. Required Cookies These cookies are required to use this website and can't be turned off. Required Cookies Show More Details Required Cookies Provider Description Enabled SAP as service provider We use the following session cookies, which are all required to enable the website to function: \"route\" is used for session stickiness \"careerSiteCompanyId\" is used to send the request to the correct data center \"JSESSIONID\" is placed on the visitor's device during the session so the server can identify the visitor \"Load balancer cookie\" (actual cookie name may vary)  prevents a visitor from bouncing from one instance to another Cookies from provider SAPasserviceprovider are required and cannot be turned off Confirm My Choices Accept All Cookies"
